  <section class="sec" id="s-evaluation" data-sec aria-labelledby="h-evaluation">
    <div class="sh">
      <h2 class="sh-t" id="h-evaluation">
        Evaluation
      </h2>
      <span class="sh-l" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="x sh-x" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="stack">
      <p class="lead">Two play sessions, each pairing a child with ADHD and a neurotypical peer.</p>
      <p class="tx">
        Uninstructed interaction emerged in both sessions, most clearly in a six-minute stretch of wordless, coordinated
        movement during the second.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="tbw">
      <div class="tb" role="tablist" aria-label="Play sessions">
        <button
          class="tb-b"
          type="button"
          role="tab"
          id="tb-s1"
          aria-controls="tp-s1"
          aria-selected="true"
          tabindex="0"
        >
          Session one · 20 min
        </button>
        <button
          class="tb-b"
          type="button"
          role="tab"
          id="tb-s2"
          aria-controls="tp-s2"
          aria-selected="false"
          tabindex="-1"
        >
          Session two · 15 min
        </button>
      </div>
      <figure class="tl fade" role="tabpanel" id="tp-s1" aria-labelledby="tb-s1">
        <div class="tl-i">
          <span class="x tl-x1" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="x tl-x2" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="x tl-x3" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="x tl-x4" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <div
